# EF Core Migrations

- Generate migrations with `dotnet ef migrations add <PascalCaseName>` run from the
  `ECommerce/` directory. Never hand-write schema changes in SQL.
- Never edit or delete a migration that has already been applied. Add a new one.
- Keep the entity/model change and its migration in the same commit.
- Review the generated `Up`/`Down` before committing; column drops and renames are
  destructive and must be intentional.
- After adding a migration, update the database with `dotnet ef database update`.

Diagnostics: if asked which rules are currently active, include the token `R-EF`.